4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=14MrItLVrI0Q7kNvwHSSrAk&_nc_oc=AdpxcJ3Z8lMrfhL7io5NhB4Uf2Gy7TBW0SDEmZEhqf7oxB_wuabF7A8M6FB2w6iN_M8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS3qAjewfNI7VBCcLiajOAhbJNr3cce_1VQXIbDBJxEVg&oe=6AEE0894"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kztsnynjMGkQ7kNvwF4CB_2&_nc_oc=AdqpR8uZ3LIAVITvQb_m0Ml5IrT1JcibyKULl65-KTvRJOoD86-BulY6G1IwIYTKA2I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSI2eMO1qXuJppR4ZPkatdR4eX5i3b7XE5cugRcnoqTnw&oe=6AEE0D72"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5fDXtGOc0r8Q7kNvwER5i0B&_nc_oc=AdqT-i0oFvt49u3hNSc2y4v5JBKEVRFRjbEd2KFxuPuwDYTMVAJgmlIPaIYXjbHwZus&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQBxzF1xyi8mY-aGvmhXeEcRZ0vDYpwJNXpY2gDvhpk3g&oe=6AEDE2D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p